# Discarding your hand is a discard (CR 701.9): when Phyrexian Dragon Engine's enters trigger is accepted, every card
# in the hand is discarded together and a "whenever you discard one or more cards" ability sees it. Marauding Mako gets
# two counters from Faithless Looting, then one for each of the cards discarded from the hand.

